                    <div class="text-bright-gray font-light text-lg text-center md:text-left leading-7"><p><strong>“Pollfish/Prodege has allowed us to run monthly tracking surveys with minimal maintenance.”</strong><br />
”Pollfish allows us to run A/B tests with features that ensure our clients continue trusting us, like screencap prevention software and data quality checks.”</p>
